    "name": "loss_rankgap_reweight_logsigmoid_clamped_weighted_mean_m3",
    "intuition": "Fix the static gate by providing a non-empty `implementation_hint.expects`. Stabilize the original rank-gap reweighting by removing the swap-symmetry term (it cancels preference direction by making the loss even in the logit), and instead use a standard pairwise `-logsigmoid` on a clamped winner-minus-loser logit. Keep rank-based emphasis via a detached, z-scored `delta_rank` passed through `softplus`, and normalize nonnegative weights by their sum to prevent blow-ups when weights vary.",
